3
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:14,276
avoid a slippery rock and report anything sharp Nobody should wade into

4
00:00:14,289 --> 00:00:18,408
a rough inlet or attempt to retrieve waste from a reef A

5
00:00:18,421 --> 00:00:23,053
changing tide could create peril even when the water looked calm Our

6
00:00:23,066 --> 00:00:26,224
group found a length of fishing line a torn net and a

7
